               <text>
                  <paragraph>citric acid, cherry flavor, edetate disodium, glycerin, maltitol, polyethylene glycol, propylene glycol, purified water, sodium benzoate, sodium metabisulfite, sorbitol, sucralose, trisodium citrate dihydrate, xanthan gum.</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20220727"/>
            </section>
